# Razer Blade Stealth late 2019 (LY320 / RZ09-03101) — Ice Lake
# Board from CL 37565 (Johanna Schander / Mimoja). Stitched 16 MiB image:
# IFD+ME from local vendor dump + SeaBIOS + Ice Lake FSP + microcode 06-7e-05.
# Proprietary blobs stay local (gitignored *.bin / intel-microcode / fsp).
# Do NOT flashrom -w until emberrom PREFLASH.md signoff is GO.
CONFIG_VENDOR_RAZER=y
CONFIG_BOARD_RAZER_BLADE_STEALTH_ICL=y
CONFIG_CBFS_SIZE=0x200000
CONFIG_CONSOLE_CBMEM_BUFFER_SIZE=0x20000
CONFIG_HAVE_IFD_BIN=y
CONFIG_HAVE_ME_BIN=y
CONFIG_DO_NOT_TOUCH_DESCRIPTOR_REGION=y
CONFIG_SUBSYSTEM_VENDOR_ID=0x0000
CONFIG_SUBSYSTEM_DEVICE_ID=0x0000
CONFIG_I2C_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT_US=500000
CONFIG_SEABIOS_DEBUG_LEVEL=-1
